h('What happened during verification')
table([['<b>Check on a file protected with secret 2026</b>','<b>Image and audio result</b>'],['Verify with team-secret-2026','Authentic; message returned'],['Verify with team-secret-2027, scan enabled','Wrong Start Location; message not returned'],['Verify with team-secret-2027, scan disabled','Payload Missing; message not returned'],['Compare masked hash before/after embedding','Identical for both covers'],['Manual: correct pixel/frame; then incorrect unit 0','Authentic with correct input; Wrong Start Location with incorrect input']],[306,197])
p('Manual values tested: image pixel (300, 300) -> unit 461,700; audio frame 20,000 -> unit 40,000. Test message: "FR7 demonstration". Sample files and existing keys were not overwritten. These were direct engine checks, not a fresh GUI recording.')
